WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:32.850
A busy diary can still hide an unready decision. In this learning unit, you will learn how planning creates a reliable executive-support partnership. Diary management is one practical application: your plan must fit the executive’s commitments and the plans of everyone who contributes. A busy calendar does not show whether the right people are available, the necessary papers are ready, or a change has been approved. You will practise checking these conditions and recording them in a working agreement and a decision brief.
